% Cut confinement (AC-2): cut `!` is permitted under ProceduralPrologProfile.
% ex:first(X,Y) :- ex:parentOf(X,Y), !. commits to the sorted-first answer.
% EDB is sorted, so b comes before c; expected: only Y=b, status ok.
:- prefix(ex, 'https://example.org/profiles/goal-procedural-cut/').
ex:first(X,Y) :- ex:parentOf(X,Y), !.
?- ex:first(ex:a, Y).
